# Kolyan Indirovich at his grave: the horseman card's ally (ADR 0011). He can be raised by a priest or bard who
# commands the magic for it (Raise Dead, level 9) and 500 gp of diamonds for the rite.
# Speak with Dead (2024 PHB; docs/story/talking_creatures.md) at his coffin in the mansion or at his grave: where he
# found Ireena, the other half of Izek's story (vallaki/izek.dialogue), and his wife's brooch behind the study desk
# (study_panel). Not once he's raised: then he answers for himself.

~ coffin
narrate examine:kolyan_coffin
-> dead_menu

~ grave
# Raised, then told "Rest a while": he waits on his own grave until the party comes back for him.
if flag.kolyan_raised and not guest:kolyan_indirovich
-> visit
endif
Narrator: Fresh earth, a board with his name burned into it, and someone's wildflowers already gone brown.
if tarokka.ally.npc == kolyan_indirovich and not guest:kolyan_indirovich and not flag.kolyan_raised
interject guest:ismark: Madam Eva said Father would ride with us. I thought she meant his memory. She didn't, did she.
-> raise_menu
endif
if flag.kolyan_raised
-> END
endif
-> dead_menu

~ raise_menu
* [if (class:cleric or class:bard) and level >= 9 and gold >= 500] Call him back: the rite, and five hundred gold of diamonds in the grave. -> raise
* [if not ((class:cleric or class:bard) and level >= 9)] (Raising the dead needs a cleric or bard of ninth level.) -> END
* [if (class:cleric or class:bard) and level >= 9 and gold < 500] (The rite needs 500 gp of diamonds.) -> END
* [if spell:speak_with_dead and not flag.kolyan_spoke] Ask him a few questions first. -> speak_dead
* [if not spell:speak_with_dead and not flag.kolyan_spoke] [knows:speak_with_dead] (Cast Speak with Dead, and ask him a few questions first.) -> speak_dead_cast
* Let him rest. -> END

~ dead_menu
* [if spell:speak_with_dead and not flag.kolyan_spoke] Ask the burgomaster a few questions. -> speak_dead
* [if not spell:speak_with_dead and not flag.kolyan_spoke] [knows:speak_with_dead] (Cast Speak with Dead, and ask the burgomaster a few questions.) -> speak_dead_cast
* [if spell:speak_with_dead or knows:speak_with_dead] Let him rest. -> END
-> END

# Back to whichever menu brought the party here: the raising, at the grave of the horseman card's ally, or the dead.
~ back
if tarokka.ally.npc == kolyan_indirovich and not guest:kolyan_indirovich and not flag.kolyan_raised and not at:burgomaster_mansion
-> raise_menu
endif
-> dead_menu

~ speak_dead_cast
cast speak_with_dead
if check.last
-> speak_dead
endif
-> back

~ speak_dead
set kolyan_spoke
Narrator: The voice that answers is hoarse and impatient, a man interrupted halfway through an argument he meant to win.
Narrator: "Ireena? I found her on the lake road past Vallaki, the winter the wolves were bad. Red hair full of frost, bare feet, and no name she would give me."
Narrator: "A boy was shouting a name through the trees, over and over. I took it for the wolves, using a boy's voice. I wrapped her in my coat and never went back to ask whose she was."
if flag.izek_story_heard and not flag.izek_sister_truth
-> sister
endif
if not flag.izek_sister_truth
set ireena_finding_known
endif
-> brooch

~ sister
set izek_sister_truth
quest izek_obsession truth_guessed
Narrator: Izek Strazni's little sister, lost in the woods past the lake the night the wolves took his arm. Never found, because a burgomaster from over the hills found her first.
-> brooch

~ brooch
Narrator: "There's a loose panel behind my study desk, and my wife's brooch behind it. It turned an arrow for her once. Give it to whoever stands between Ireena and that door now."
reveal study_panel
if flag.burial_method == "church_rites" or flag.burial_method == "cleric_rites"
interject tag:pious: Somebody promised him no voice would call him up again. We've had our questions. Let him go back down.
endif
-> back

~ raise
gold -500
set kolyan_raised
Narrator: The earth heaves, settles, heaves. A hand the colour of tallow finds the board with his name on it and pushes it over.
Kolyan Indirovich: Twenty years I kept this village. Two weeks dead and you lot are digging me up. Is the church still standing?
interject guest:ireena: Father. It's me.
Kolyan Indirovich: I know who you are, girl. I'm dead, not blind. Help an old man up.
* Strahd is still out there. Ride with us. -> join
* Rest a while. We'll come back for you. -> later

~ join
Kolyan Indirovich: My heart gave out the last time he came knocking. Let's see if it does better the second time. Give me a sword I can lift.
join kolyan_indirovich
-> END

~ later
Kolyan Indirovich: Then I'll sit on my own grave and frighten the gravedigger. Don't be long. I've lost enough time.
-> END

~ visit
Narrator: Kolyan sits on his own grave with the board across his knees. The gravedigger is working at the far end of the churchyard today.
Kolyan Indirovich: Back, are you? I'm ready when you are.
* Ride with us. -> join
* Not yet. -> END
